  "notes": "{生|は}える means for something to grow or sprout naturally.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{生|は}やす→生やす：02399_hayasu⟧ (transitive - to grow, let grow)\n\nWHAT CAN {生|は}える:\n- ⟦{草|くさ}→草：02206_kusa⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{生|は}える: grass grows\n- ⟦{歯|は}→歯：00778_ha⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{生|は}える: teeth come in\n- ⟦{髭|ひげ}→ひげ：01332_hige⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{生|は}える: beard grows\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{生|は}える: hair grows\n- ⟦カビ→カビ：07055_kabi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{生|は}える: mold grows\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{生|は}えている: ~ is growing (state)\n- 〜⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{生|は}えてきた: ~ has started to grow\n\nHOMOPHONE DISTINCTION:\n- {生|は}える: to grow (plants, hair, teeth)\n- ⟦{映|は}える→映える：02393_haeru⟧: to look good, to stand out",
